# Base: f0c3037e434c706f36b37d234fe24babdf2ddf40
# Scope: introduce canonical ToolExecutionCoordinator around the existing
# production ToolExecutionPort implementation. No Phase 5.7+ retry engine,
# persistence, events, MCP-specific logic, or AgentRuntime redesign.
#
# Guarantees:
# - validate execution/iteration/tool-call identity before dispatch
# - reject duplicate tool_call_id values in one model response
# - bounded parallel execution at coordinator boundary
# - deterministic result ordering by original tool-call order
# - reject missing/duplicate/unexpected results from downstream ports
# - preserve ToolExecutionPort contract so AgentRuntime remains unchanged
# - optional retry hook is injectable but defaults to one attempt (no retry)
#
